message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "agent-warden: runtime policy guard for autonomous AI agents"
abstract: "agent-warden is a runtime policy guard for autonomous AI agents: it enforces kill/flag policy on a live agent process and produces a forensic report of what the agent actually did, judging the agent by its behavior rather than its configuration."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Bosch Rodriguez"
    given-names: "Rolando"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0005-4896-1112"
    affiliation: "Hermes Labs"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/hermes-labs-ai/agent-warden"
version: "0.1.4"
keywords:
  - "AI reliability"
  - "agent safety"
  - "policy enforcement"
  - "runtime guard"
  - "forensic reporting"
